      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SERENA SAID (1) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 6 lengths (19.66) at Bulli in a Maiden over 340m. Top chance in this line up. BIG TOWN JADE (3) finished second (18.60) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 7th there. A big run wouldn't surprise. CONQUER THE ROAD (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Mischievous Evie (18.32) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can feature again. MISS ENVIOUS (4) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
